§§ `ss 35-37 -- serious injuries, dangerous incidents`

#ASSERT `Is my injury a serious injury or illness` `immediate treatment as an in-patient in a hospital` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my injury a serious injury or illness` `immediate treatment for the amputation of part of the body` EQUALS JUST TRUE
