#ASSERT `Was it a dangerous incident` TRUE TRUE TRUE `another kind of event` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Was it a dangerous incident` FALSE TRUE TRUE `electric shock` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it a dangerous incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE `an uncontrolled implosion, explosion or fire` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was it a dangerous incident` TRUE TRUE TRUE `no exposure` EQUALS JUST FALSE

