§§ `ss 112-115 -- the orders`

-- Knew on 1 June 2025; no other proceedings.
GIVEN o IS AN `Order`, k IS A `Kind of complaint`, aff IS A BOOLEAN, start IS A DATE, w IS A `What was done`, r IS A `Why it was done`, disproved IS A BOOLEAN, defence IS A BOOLEAN, act IS A BOOLEAN, intent IS A BOOLEAN, emerg IS A BOOLEAN, s111 IS A BOOLEAN, comp IS A BOOLEAN, emp IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`court` o k aff start w r disproved defence act intent emerg s111 comp emp MEANS
    `Can the court make this order for me` o k aff (`d` 1 6 2025) start FALSE FALSE w r disproved defence act intent emerg s111 comp emp

`disc` MEANS `discriminatory conduct for a prohibited reason`
`induce` MEANS `asking, instructing, inducing, encouraging, authorising or assisting another to engage in it`
`coerce` MEANS `coercion or inducement contrary to s 108`
`reinstate` MEANS `reinstatement, re-employment or employment`
`in time` MEANS `d` 1 3 2026

GIVEN o IS AN `Order`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
