§§ `Part 2 -- which offence, and its penalty`

`pcbu` MEANS `an individual conducting the business or undertaking, or an officer of it`
`body` MEANS `a body corporate conducting the business or undertaking`
`other` MEANS `another individual, such as a worker or other person at the workplace`
`assoc` MEANS `an unincorporated association`
`IM` MEANS `industrial manslaughter (s 29C)`
`Cat 1` MEANS `a Category 1 offence (s 31)`
`Cat 2` MEANS `a Category 2 offence (s 32)`
`Cat 3` MEANS `a Category 3 offence (s 33)`
`none` MEANS `no offence under Part 2 on these facts`

